Thai Waters Rev F | speaker_overdrive
* Differential 3.90 V peak sine at 1 kHz into 5.4 ohms.
* Model: Voltage envelope applied differentially to J9. A resistive load bounds the nominal sine heating; excludes PA gain, clipping, PWM, resonance and acoustic SPL.
Vcm cm 0 2.1
Vone plus cm SIN(0 1.95 1000)
Vtwo cm minus SIN(0 1.95 1000)
Rcoil plus minus 5.4
Ediff diff 0 plus minus 1
.TRAN 5u 4m 0 5u
.PRINT TRAN V(diff)
.END
